I go into the kitchen.
The kitchen is small.
I look there.
Some things are already kept here.
I look down.
There are cabinets below the counter.
I open a cabinet.
Some large pots are kept in the cabinet.
These pots are heavy.
Then I look up.
There is a shelf on the wall above.
Some cups are kept on the shelf.
They are very clean.
Some plates are also kept near the cups.
Everything is kept in its place.
I like this kitchen.
